    "chunk_text": "\u00e6t tacna\u00f0 gesynto & h\u00e6lo. On xxv & on xxvi nihta, \u00fe\u00e6t tacna\u00f0 toweardlice firhto & brogan & on ix dagum o\u00fe\u00fee on x \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 On xxvii & on xxviii nihta, \u00fe\u00e6t tacna\u00f0 ealne gefean, & ealle angnysse & unea\u00f0nysse smyltnysse & On xxix nihta, eall swa \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6rre. On xxx nihta, \u00e6r twegra nihta fyrste \u00fe\u00e6t swefen ag\u00e6\u00f0 butan frecnum \u00feingum..",
